                <head>46. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On January 16, 1959, Secretary McElroy and General Twining briefed the Senate
                    Foreign Relations Committee in executive session on the state of U.S. military
                    defenses. A 93-page typescript record of this briefing is in the National
                    Archives and Records Administration, RG 46, Records of the United States Senate
                    Committee on Foreign Relations. The transcript is printed in <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Executive Sessions of the Senate Foreign Relations
                        Committee (Historical Series), 1959</hi>, pages 17–53.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
